{"resourceIdentifier":"4198","resourceName":"Yongtai Danyun Duck Farm Manure Composting Project","description":"Yongtai Danyun Duck Farm Manure Composting Project (hereafter referred to as the project) introduces the aerobic composting system to treat the duck manure from Yongtai Danyun Duck Farm of Yongtai Golden Egg Project in Danyun Village, Yongtai County, Fuzhou City, Fujian Province, China. The purpose of the project activity is to avoid methane emissions through controlled aerobic treatment by composting duck manure.\r\nThe project comprises of solid-liquid separation system, composting system, and fertilizer packaging system. It is estimated that approximately 47,413.5 tonnes of duck manure can be treated annually, and the annual organic fertilizer production is 15,000 tonnes. Part of the organic fertilizer will be distributed to nearby farmers for free and most of it will be sold to local businesses. The project activity will reduce GHG in the atmosphere by avoiding methane emissions from controlled aerobic treatment by composting duck manure.","location":{"latitude":25.985589,"longitude":119.012698},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-03-29","endExclusive":"2023-04-29","endInclusive":"2023-04-28"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4198"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Fujian"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Yongtai Golden Egg Development Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Fujian Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 21 23019950"},{"type":"string","value":"3542346576@qq.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"35490"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"c